  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"509\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"204\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"207\">Spirit Ink is more than streetwear. it’s myth you can wear. Each piece fuses traditional sumi-e brushwork with cyberpunk neon fragments, creating unfinished-yet-complete art that feels hand-painted onto garments. Our drops aren’t just fashion; they’re relics of resilience, discipline, and identity.</p><p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"815\"><strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"539\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"542\">We reject empty hype and disposable trends. Every Spirit Ink design carries meaning. A myth fragment written in ink and silence. Negative space and glitch accents turn the garment itself into part of the art. Wearers don’t just wear clothes; they step into their legend.</p><p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"1108\"><strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"845\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"848\">Affiliates earn commission on every referred sale. As Spirit Ink grows, so do your rewards. &nbsp;The more you help expand the tribe, the more you benefit. It’s not just about sales, but about building a community of warriors, protectors, and legends in training.</p><p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1454\"><strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1132\">How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1135\">Affiliates succeed by sharing the story. Highlight our unique sumi-e × cyberpunk aesthetic, the mythic meaning behind each drop, and the emotional transformation of wearing Spirit Ink. Social media, reels, styling posts, and authentic storytelling drive the strongest connection. Show pride, discipline, and identity.</p><p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1784\"><strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1478\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1481\">Spirit Ink products are built on heavyweight, premium blanks with durability and detail. We offer limited drops and special editions, making each piece collectible. Our brand is rooted in authenticity, family, and culture. Affiliates are not just marketers, but partners in carrying the myth forward.</p></div></div>",
